          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "To be called; to be named. [Obs.] There as I was wont to hote Arcite, Now hight I Philostrate, not worth a mite. Chaucer.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        }
      ],
      "relatedWords": []
    },
